<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-astyanax-mexicanus-turing-wavelength-s0-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Turing wavenumber at 666 nm in the Astyanax cave morph — Morphological realism / specimen match: 74/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The GIF is a 12-frame, 960x522 animation on the real cave-morph photograph. At overlay beta 0.42 the patch reads as flank mottling, and the fish silhouette is the voucher. The match is carried by that silhouette. A 666 nm mode is below the optical resolution of the photograph, so the panel cannot be a literal specimen of the wavelength." ;
